// Title: WinSxS Executable File Creation By Non-System Process
// Rule ID: 34746e8c-5fb8-415a-b135-0abc167e912a
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution
// Category: file_event
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
